  {
   "Id": "m0102:0x0600039A",
   "ProposedName": "ReadValue",
   "Reason": "Parses the envelope; empty cipher means null. Otherwise derives a 32-byte key using one SHA256 PBKDF2 iteration, authenticates/decrypts AES-CCM with a 128-bit tag and salt as associated data, then decodes the full plaintext buffer. InvalidCipherTextException becomes InvalidOperationException. Public name and parameters stay unchanged.",
